sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Worker Client
    participant RenMgr as Renewal Manager / Gateway
    participant Leader as Raft Leader
    participant Quorum as Raft Majority Quorum
    participant FSM as Deterministic FSM

    Note over Client,RenMgr: Active Lock: FencingToken = T, LeaseVersion = V
    Client->>RenMgr: POST /v1/locks/renew {resource, owner_id, fencing_token: T, ttl}
    
    RenMgr->>Leader: Proxy Renew Request to Authoritative Leader
    Note over Leader: Validate active leader term

    Leader->>Quorum: Replicate RenewLockCommand across Raft log
    Quorum-->>Leader: Majority Acknowledgment (Quorum 2/3)

    Leader->>FSM: Apply Renew Command to FSM
    Note over FSM: 1. Verify Resource Exists & Active<br/>2. Match Owner ID == Active Owner<br/>3. Verify fencing_token == Active Token T<br/>4. Extend Expiry: now + TTL<br/>5. Exact Increment: LeaseVersion = V + 1<br/>6. FencingToken T REMAINS UNCHANGED

    FSM-->>Leader: Success Result {fencing_token: T, lease_version: V+1}
    Leader-->>RenMgr: HTTP 200 OK
    RenMgr-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK {fencing_token: T, lease_version: V+1, expires_at}

